        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS.",
        "AbstractText": "Heart failure is a pathology which is constantly growing due to the ageing population. It is defined as the heart's inability to pump enough blood to meet the body's metabolic and nutritional needs. Treatment varies depending on the acute or chronic phases. The care pathway is sometimes complex. Monitoring and patient education are essential."
